# Owned by the project template (cs-project-template): change it there.
# The C++ style of every cscosine repository: standard LLVM, lines up to 120 characters (as Python's, ruff).
# Standard: Latest only makes clang-format parse modern C++. https://clang.llvm.org/docs/ClangFormatStyleOptions.html
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
Standard: Latest
ColumnLimit: 120
